e sea."}],"full_text":"Neptunia is an aquatic Krono-Titan with purple skin and elf-like ears.\n\n== History ==\nNeptunia is used by the Organization to get Suits out from tricky situations. [SAS-088]\n\n== Abilities ==\nNeptunia She is also able to utilize her Aquablasts ability to sacrifice her energy to take out an opponent. [SAS-088]\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nNeptunia Icon.jpg|Neptunia's Icon\n\n== Trivia ==\n* Neptunia's name and appearance were based on Neptune, the Roman god of the sea.","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox Titan\n| image   = File:Neptunia.jpg\n| attack  = 2\n| defense = 2\n| type    = [[Krono-Titan]]\n| size    = Average\n| ability = Aquablast\n| height  = 4 feet 8 inches\n| weight  = 90 pounds\n| users   = [[Suits]]\n| first   = [[SAS-088]]\n}}\n'''Neptunia''' is an aquatic [[Krono-Titan]] with purple skin and elf-like ears.\n\n== History ==\nNeptunia is used by [[the Organization]] to get [[Suits]] out from tricky situations. {{source|SAS-088}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nNeptunia She is also able to utilize her Aquablasts ability to sacrifice her energy to take out an opponent. {{source|SAS-088}}\n\n== Gallery ==\n{{gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nNeptunia Icon.jpg|Neptunia's Icon\n</gallery>\n\n== Trivia ==\n* Neptunia's name and appearance were based on [[wikipedia:Neptune|Neptune]], the Roman god of the sea.\n[[Category:Titans]]\n[[Category:Krono-Titans]]\n[[Category:Organization Titans]]\n[[Category:Average Titans]]\n[[Category:TCG Titans]]\n{{Clear}}{{KronoBox}}","categories":["Average Titans","Krono-Titans","Organization Titans","TCG Titans","Titans"],"links":[{"target_title":"Krono-Titan","label":"Krono-Titan","target_id":"huntik:page:2836","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Krono-Titan","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Krono-Titans"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Ap